<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>About – MMUN | Modern Minds Unifying Network</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --navy: #0D1F3C;
      --blue: #1A3C6E;
      --accent: #2E75B6;
      --accent-light: #5BA3D9;
      --gold: #C9A84C;
      --bg: #F7F8FA;
      --surface: #FFFFFF;
      --text: #1C2B3A;
      --muted: #5A6A7A;
      --border: #DDE4EC;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    /* ── HEADER ── */
    header {
      background: var(--navy);
      padding: 56px 24px 48px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    header::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 80% at 20% 50%, rgba(46,117,182,0.25) 0%, transparent 70%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 60% at 80% 30%, rgba(201,168,76,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .header-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; }

    #backBtn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    #backBtn:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }

    #logoImg {
      width: 70px; height: 70px;
      margin-left: 10px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-self: center;
      border-radius: 40%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgb(54,183,114);
      object-fit: contain;
      margin-right: 8px;
    }

    .app-name {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
      color: white;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .app-subtitle {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      letter-spacing: 2.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-top: 6px;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .policy-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(201,168,76,0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.4);
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 6px 18px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      margin: 24px 0 16px;
    }

    .header-tagline {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      margin-top: 8px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* ── LAYOUT ── */
    .wrapper {
      max-width: 820px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px 80px;
    }

    /* ── TOC ── */
    .toc {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 32px 36px;
      margin: 48px 0 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(13,31,60,0.06);
    }

    .toc-title {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .toc-title::after {
      content: '';
      flex: 1;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--border);
    }

    .toc ol {
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 8px 24px;
      counter-reset: toc-counter;
    }

    .toc li { counter-increment: toc-counter; }

    .toc a {
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 6px 0;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .toc a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

    .toc a::before {
      content: counter(toc-counter, decimal-leading-zero);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--accent-light);
      min-width: 24px;
    }

    /* ── SECTIONS ── */
    section {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 36px 40px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(13,31,60,0.04);
      animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease both;
    }

    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    section:nth-child(2)  { animation-delay: 0.05s; }
    section:nth-child(3)  { animation-delay: 0.10s; }
    section:nth-child(4)  { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
    section:nth-child(5)  { animation-delay: 0.20s; }
    section:nth-child(6)  { animation-delay: 0.25s; }
    section:nth-child(7)  { animation-delay: 0.30s; }
    section:nth-child(8)  { animation-delay: 0.35s; }
    section:nth-child(9)  { animation-delay: 0.40s; }

    .section-number {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-light);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    h3 {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--blue);
      margin: 24px 0 10px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    }

    p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    ul {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }

    ul li {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    ul li::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 10px;
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent-light);
    }

    ul li strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

    /* ── HIGHLIGHT BOX ── */
    .highlight-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,60,110,0.04), rgba(46,117,182,0.06));
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      margin: 16px 0;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--blue);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* ── STATS GRID ── */
    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin: 20px 0 8px;
    }

    .stat-card {
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stat-number {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.9rem;
      color: var(--navy);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-top: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* ── FEATURES GRID ── */
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 22px 20px;
      transition: box-shadow 0.2s;
    }

    .feature-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(13,31,60,0.08); }

    .feature-icon {
      width: 40px; height: 40px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .icon-blue  { background: rgba(46,117,182,0.1); }
    .icon-gold  { background: rgba(201,168,76,0.1); }
    .icon-teal  { background: rgba(29,158,117,0.1); }
    .icon-coral { background: rgba(216,90,48,0.1); }
    .icon-purple{ background: rgba(83,74,183,0.1); }
    .icon-pink  { background: rgba(212,83,126,0.1); }

    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      text-transform: none;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    /* ── MODULES TABLE ── */
    .module-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr auto;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: start;
      padding: 18px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .module-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0; }
    .module-row:first-child { padding-top: 0; }

    .module-num {
      width: 34px; height: 34px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,60,110,0.08), rgba(46,117,182,0.12));
      border: 1px solid rgba(46,117,182,0.2);
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--accent);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .module-name {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .module-desc {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .module-pill {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      white-space: nowrap;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .pill-social  { background: rgba(46,117,182,0.1);  color: var(--accent); }
    .pill-identity{ background: rgba(29,158,117,0.1);  color: #0F6E56; }
    .pill-comms   { background: rgba(212,83,126,0.1);  color: #993556; }
    .pill-alerts  { background: rgba(201,168,76,0.12); color: #854F0B; }
    .pill-events  { background: rgba(216,90,48,0.1);   color: #993C1D; }
    .pill-opp     { background: rgba(83,74,183,0.1);   color: #3C3489; }

    /* ── DARK GRADIENT SECTION ── */
    .dark-section {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy), var(--blue));
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 36px 40px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease both;
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .dark-section h2 {
      color: #fff;
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .dark-section p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); }

    .trust-pills {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .trust-pill {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* ── TIMELINE ── */
    .timeline {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 28px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .timeline::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 9px; top: 8px; bottom: 8px;
      width: 1.5px;
      background: var(--border);
    }

    .tl-item {
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .tl-item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .tl-dot {
      position: absolute;
      left: -28px; top: 6px;
      width: 10px; height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
      border: 2px solid var(--surface);
    }

    .tl-label {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-light);
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .tl-title {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .tl-body {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 3px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    /* ── CONTACT CARD ── */
    .contact-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy), var(--blue));
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 28px 20px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .contact-icon {
      width: 48px; height: 48px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .contact-icon svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; fill: white; }

    .contact-info { flex: 1; min-width: 200px; }
    .contact-info p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size: 0.82rem; margin: 0 0 4px; }
    .contact-info a { color: white; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; font-size: 1rem; }
    .contact-info a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .contact-region {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    footer span { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      section, .dark-section { padding: 28px 20px; }
      .toc { padding: 24px 20px; }
      .toc ol { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .contact-card { flex-direction: column; }
      header { padding: 40px 20px 36px; }
      .module-row { grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr; row-gap: 6px; }
      .module-row > :last-child { grid-column: 2; }
      .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 380px) {
      .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header onclick="window.location.href='/home'">
        <img id="logoImg" src="/Assets/MmunLogoTopPart.png" alt="MMUN Logo" />
      </div>
      <div class="app-name">MMUN</div>
      <div class="app-subtitle">Modern Minds Unifying Network</div>
      <div class="policy-badge">About MMUN</div>
      <p class="header-tagline">Where modern minds meet.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="wrapper">

    <!-- TOC -->
    <div class="toc">
      <div class="toc-title">Contents</div>
      <ol>
        <li><a href="#s1">Who We Are</a></li>
        <li><a href="#s2">Our Mission</a></li>
        <li><a href="#s3">Platform at a Glance</a></li>
        <li><a href="#s4">What Makes Us Different</a></li>
        <li><a href="#s5">The Six Modules</a></li>
        <li><a href="#s6">Trust &amp; Verification</a></li>
        <li><a href="#s7">Our Story</a></li>
        <li><a href="#s8">Copyright &amp; Legal</a></li>
        <li><a href="#s9">Contact Us</a></li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <!-- 1 -->
    <section id="s1">
      <div class="section-number">Section 01</div>
      <h2>Who We Are</h2>
      <p>MMUN (Modern Minds Unifying Network) is a specialised social media platform designed exclusively for university and college students. Founded by Ndung'u Patrick Ngotho, MMUN was built on the recognition that students have higher cognitive capacity, unique social needs, and untapped professional potential that general social media platforms fail to serve.</p>
      <p>We operate primarily in Kenya and East Africa, with a vision to become the definitive student network across the continent.</p>
      <div class="highlight-box">MMUN is registered with the Kenya Copyright Board — Registration No. 522922641.</div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2 -->
    <section id="s2">
      <div class="section-number">Section 02</div>
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>Our mission is to build a trusted, student-exclusive ecosystem that enhances academic collaboration, social connection, and real-world opportunity — all in one place.</p>
      <p>We believe that university students deserve a platform built specifically for them: one that respects their intelligence, supports their ambitions, and connects them not just with their classmates, but with opportunities, institutions, and each other across every campus in the region.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- 3 -->
    <section id="s3">
      <div class="section-number">Section 03</div>
      <h2>Platform at a Glance</h2>
      <p>MMUN is a comprehensive student platform combining social networking, institutional communication, peer commerce, event discovery, and career development.</p>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-number">6</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Core modules</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-number">18+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Verified users only</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-number">100%</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Student-verified</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-number">KE</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Based in Kenya</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4 -->
    <section id="s4">
      <div class="section-number">Section 04</div>
      <h2>What Makes Us Different</h2>
      <p>Unlike general social media platforms, MMUN is purpose-built for the university student experience. Every feature was designed with student needs at its centre.</p>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon icon-blue">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2E75B6" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 20c0-4 3.6-7 8-7s8 3 8 7"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Cross-university networking</h3>
          <p>Connect with students from other institutions across Kenya — not just your own campus. Filter the Persons page by university, course, or year.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon icon-teal">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1D9E75" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M18 8h1a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-1"/><path d="M2 8h16v9a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H6a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8z"/><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="4"/><line x1="10" y1="1" x2="10" y2="4"/><line x1="14" y1="1" x2="14" y2="4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Smart announcements</h3>
          <p>Subscribe to class reps and administrators via a subscriber ID. Get instant Notics for class venues, cancellations, and campus updates.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon icon-gold">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.8"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Student marketplace</h3>
          <p>MABS lets students trade goods — textbooks, calculators, lab equipment — directly with peers within the same institution.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon icon-coral">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#D85A30" stroke-width="1.8"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M16 3H8L2 7h20l-6-4z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Real job opportunities</h3>
          <p>Companies, government bodies, and organisations post internships and jobs directly to verified students — apply without leaving the app.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon icon-purple">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#534AB7" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M8 6h13M8 12h13M8 18h13M3 6h.01M3 12h.01M3 18h.01"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Leaderboard &amp; recognition</h3>
          <p>A monthly leaderboard ranks students by blog visits, with prizes for top performers — rewarding active, engaged community members.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon icon-pink">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#D4537E" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Private &amp; group chats</h3>
          <p>Real-time messaging with voice and video calls powered by WebRTC. Customisable themes and file sharing — built for how students actually communicate.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5 -->
    <section id="s5">
      <div class="section-number">Section 05</div>
      <h2>The Six Modules</h2>
      <p>MMUN is organised around six core modules, each serving a distinct but interconnected purpose in the student experience.</p>

      <div class="module-row">
        <div class="module-num">01</div>
        <div>
          <div class="module-name">Posts</div>
          <div class="module-desc">Share text, images, and videos with your university or across all institutions. Like, comment, share, and report content. Post to a specific institution or broadcast to all.</div>
        </div>
        <div><span class="module-pill pill-social">Social</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="module-row">
        <div class="module-num">02</div>
        <div>
          <div class="module-name">Profiles &amp; Blogs</div>
          <div class="module-desc">Personal blogs with photo gallery, social status, and contact links. Public or private — controlled by the user. Interest-based connection requests for private profiles.</div>
        </div>
        <div><span class="module-pill pill-identity">Identity</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="module-row">
        <div class="module-num">03</div>
        <div>
          <div class="module-name">Chats &amp; Calls</div>
          <div class="module-desc">Private messaging, group chats, voice calls, and video calls powered by WebRTC. Customisable colour themes. Voice mute and video hide controls during calls.</div>
        </div>
        <div><span class="module-pill pill-comms">Comms</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="module-row">
        <div class="module-num">04</div>
        <div>
          <div class="module-name">Notics</div>
          <div class="module-desc">Subscribe to announcers via subscriber IDs. Receive real-time notifications from class reps, administrators, and campus organisations. System notifications for profile activity too.</div>
        </div>
        <div><span class="module-pill pill-alerts">Alerts</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="module-row">
        <div class="module-num">05</div>
        <div>
          <div class="module-name">Arenas</div>
          <div class="module-desc">Post and discover campus events — parties, competitions, science fairs, and gatherings. Enter to attend or hit Inspire to show interest in events you can't make.</div>
        </div>
        <div><span class="module-pill pill-events">Events</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="module-row">
        <div class="module-num">06</div>
        <div>
          <div class="module-name">Jobs &amp; MABS</div>
          <div class="module-desc">Verified internships and employment from external organisations; peer-to-peer commerce scoped within your institution. Save jobs, apply in-app, and report fake sellers.</div>
        </div>
        <div><span class="module-pill pill-opp">Opportunity</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 6 -->
    <section id="s6" class="dark-section">
      <div class="section-number" style="color:rgba(91,163,217,0.8);">Section 06</div>
      <h2>Trust &amp; Verification</h2>
      <p>Every MMUN user is verified through their institution's API before gaining access to the platform. This means only real, currently enrolled students can create accounts — no bots, no impersonators, no anonymous abuse.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:10px;">This institution-level verification creates a higher-trust environment than any general social network can offer, making every interaction — from messaging to marketplace transactions — safer and more meaningful.</p>
      <div class="trust-pills">
        <span class="trust-pill">School API verification</span>
        <span class="trust-pill">18+ users only</span>
        <span class="trust-pill">Fake seller reporting</span>
        <span class="trust-pill">Post reporting system</span>
        <span class="trust-pill">Private / public profiles</span>
        <span class="trust-pill">Interest-based connections</span>
      </div>
    </section>

